    "Source repository": "crwdns117445:0crwdne117445:0",
    "Color scheme: auto (light). Switch to light": "crwdns117447:0crwdne117447:0",
    "Link to this heading": "crwdns117449:0crwdne117449:0",
    "We as members, contributors, and leaders pledge to make participation in our\ncommunity a harassment-free experience for everyone, regardless of age, body\nsize, visible or invisible disability, ethnicity, sex characteristics, gender\nidentity and expression, level of experience, education, socio-economic status,\nnationality, personal appearance, race, caste, color, religion, or sexual\nidentity and orientation.": "crwdns117451:0crwdne117451:0",
    "We pledge to act and interact in ways that contribute to an open, welcoming,\ndiverse, inclusive, and healthy community.": "crwdns117453:0crwdne117453:0",
    "Examples of behavior that contributes to a positive environment for our\ncommunity include:": "crwdns117455:0crwdne117455:0",
    "Demonstrating empathy and kindness toward other people": "crwdns117457:0crwdne117457:0",
    "Being respectful of differing opinions, viewpoints, and experiences": "crwdns117459:0crwdne117459:0",
    "Giving and gracefully accepting constructive feedback": "crwdns117461:0crwdne117461:0",
    "Accepting responsibility and apologizing to those affected by our mistakes,\nand learning from the experience": "crwdns117463:0crwdne117463:0",
    "Focusing on what is best not just for us as individuals, but for the overall\ncommunity": "crwdns117465:0crwdne117465:0",
    "Examples of unacceptable behavior include:": "crwdns117467:0crwdne117467:0",
    "The use of sexualized language or imagery, and sexual attention or advances of\nany kind": "crwdns117469:0crwdne117469:0",
    "Trolling, insulting or derogatory comments, and personal or political attacks": "crwdns117471:0crwdne117471:0",
    "Public or private harassment": "crwdns117473:0crwdne117473:0",
    "Publishing others’ private information, such as a physical or email address,\nwithout their explicit permission": "crwdns117475:0crwdne117475:0",
    "Other conduct which could reasonably be considered inappropriate in a\nprofessional setting": "crwdns117477:0crwdne117477:0",
    "Community leaders are responsible for clarifying and enforcing our standards of\nacceptable behavior and will take appropriate and fair corrective action in\nresponse to any behavior that they deem inappropriate, threatening, offensive,\nor harmful.": "crwdns117479:0crwdne117479:0",
    "Community leaders have the right and responsibility to remove, edit, or reject\ncomments, commits, code, wiki edits, issues, and other contributions that are\nnot aligned to this Code of Conduct, and will communicate reasons for moderation\ndecisions when appropriate.": "crwdns117481:0crwdne117481:0",
    "This Code of Conduct applies within all community spaces, and also applies when\nan individual is officially representing the community in public spaces.\nExamples of representing our community include using an official e-mail address,\nposting via an official social media account, or acting as an appointed\nrepresentative at an online or offline event.": "crwdns117483:0crwdne117483:0",
    "Instances of abusive, harassing, or otherwise unacceptable behavior may be\nreported to the community leaders responsible for enforcement using our": "crwdns117485:0crwdne117485:0",
    "support center": "crwdns117487:0crwdne117487:0",
    ".\nAll complaints will be reviewed and investigated promptly and fairly.": "crwdns117489:0crwdne117489:0",
    "All community leaders are obligated to respect the privacy and security of the\nreporter of any incident.": "crwdns117491:0crwdne117491:0",
    "Community leaders will follow these Community Impact Guidelines in determining\nthe consequences for any action they deem in violation of this Code of Conduct:": "crwdns117493:0crwdne117493:0",
    "Community Impact": "crwdns117495:0crwdne117495:0",
    ": Use of inappropriate language or other behavior deemed\nunprofessional or unwelcome in the community.": "crwdns117497:0crwdne117497:0",
    "Consequence": "crwdns117499:0crwdne117499:0",
    ": A private, written warning from community leaders, providing\nclarity around the nature of the violation and an explanation of why the\nbehavior was inappropriate. A public apology may be requested.": "crwdns117501:0crwdne117501:0",
    ": A violation through a single incident or series of\nactions.": "crwdns117503:0crwdne117503:0",
    ": A warning with consequences for continued behavior. No\ninteraction with the people involved, including unsolicited interaction with\nthose enforcing the Code of Conduct, for a specified period of time. This\nincludes avoiding interactions in community spaces as well as external channels\nlike social media. Violating these terms may lead to a temporary or permanent\nban.": "crwdns117505:0crwdne117505:0",
    ": A serious violation of community standards, including\nsustained inappropriate behavior.": "crwdns117507:0crwdne117507:0",
    ": A temporary ban from any sort of interaction or public\ncommunication with the community for a specified period of time. No public or\nprivate interaction with the people involved, including unsolicited interaction\nwith those enforcing the Code of Conduct, is allowed during this period.\nViolating these terms may lead to a permanent ban.": "crwdns117509:0crwdne117509:0",
    ": Demonstrating a pattern of violation of community\nstandards, including sustained inappropriate behavior, harassment of an\nindividual, or aggression toward or disparagement of classes of individuals.": "crwdns117511:0crwdne117511:0",
    ": A permanent ban from any sort of public interaction within the\ncommunity.": "crwdns117513:0crwdne117513:0",
